{"resource": {"name": "ARCHIVED: Memphis Police Department: Public Safety Incidents", "id": "ybsi-jur4", "resource_name": null, "parent_fxf": [], "description": "Update 4/30/2024: We are currently transitioning to a new dataset for MPD Incident data a this dataset is no longer being updated. Please view the new dataset here: https://data.memphistn.gov/Public-Safety/Memphis-Police-Department-Public-Safety-Incidents/puh4-eea4/about_data\n\nThis dataset contains all crime incidents where a police report was taken. Data goes back to 2006 and is updated on a daily basis.\n\nTerms of Use: The information in this portal is provided strictly as a courtesy to the public. This website provides information as to initial crime reports, and does not reflect subsequent changes in the investigation, nature, or accuracy of the initial report. While all attempts are made to ensure the correctness and suitability of information presented here, neither the City of Memphis nor the Memphis Police Department guarantee the accuracy of the information contained herein. Crime data may be amended or corrected by the Memphis Police Department at any time. This data may not reflect the official crime index totals as reported to the Tennessee Bureau of Investigation.", "attribution": null, "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2024-08-01T21:08:20.000Z", "createdAt": "2019-09-06T16:05:42.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2024-08-01T21:08:20.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2024-04-25T07:28:33.000Z", "columns_name": ["Location", "offense_date", "state", "coord2", "Mid-South Fairgrounds Half Mile Buffer", "Memphis Police Department Stations", "Memphis Police Department Districts", "Memphis Police Department Wards", "Community Neighborhoods Boundaries 2", "crime_id", "Category", "coord1", "agency_crimetype_id", "city", "100 Block Address", "Community Neighborhoods Boundaries 1", "Community Neighborhoods Boundaries", "City Council Super Districts", "City Council Di